# 🦸‍♂️ Superhero Android App (Kotlin + AI Navigation)

An Android application built with Kotlin and MVVM architecture, designed to list, search, and detail superhero profiles. Developed as part of an engineering internship at BİM Birleşik Mağazalar A.Ş.

## 🚀 Features
- **MVVM Architecture:** Clean separation of concerns using ViewModel, Repository, and UI screens.
- **AI-Powered Navigation:** Integrated Google Gemini API to analyze natural language queries (e.g., *"Which character turns green when angry?"*) and route users directly to the corresponding profile (e.g., Hulk).
- **Cloud Media Management:** Media assets and images are stored dynamically using AWS S3 Buckets.
- **Search & Favorites:** Dynamic search bar and persistent favorite system for characters.
- **Secure Configuration:** Sensitive API keys are managed safely using environment variables and gitignore standards.

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- **Language:** Kotlin
- **UI:** Jetpack Compose / Android XML
- **Architecture:** MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel)
- **AI Integration:** Google Gemini API
- **Cloud Storage:** Amazon Web Services (AWS S3)
- **Networking:** Retrofit & REST APIs